From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebberich <sebberich@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 17:13:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 21/23] Mobile: Add the relay sync for shopping lists

Nostr relay transport (NIP-01 client over WebSocket, relay pool with
reconnect): per-list member directory, item events, join requests for
managed lists, publishing of pending changes, weekly re-publish of the
whole list so relays only need to act as a mailbox, and a live
subscription while a list is open. Nearby (Bluetooth) transport is an
interface with an "unavailable" stub for now.

